From 2592aea047ef7700417c53573026943a7762681c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: writer <writer@local>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 16:35:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] P15C Wave 2 (a): the Campaign Legacy root joins the
 Save45 step (1361-E3 r1)

1359-A section 5 and section 10 item 6, commit (a), through the shared
step's extension points (1361-F rulings 3 to 6), on p15a1-b-r2:
- src/core/campaignLegacy.ts: the v2 era. CAMPAIGN_LEGACY_DEFINITION
  reads campaign-legacy/v2, the law takes each era's thresholds as an
  argument, and LEGACY_DEFINITIONS keeps v1 frozen beside v2 as
  literals, each entry with its own evaluator (1353-F6 rulings 2 and 4;
  1359-F Amendment 1). The root's type, its empty form, and
  validateCampaignLegacy for 1359-A section 5.1 items 1 to 5: exact keys,
  recordedFromWeek within [0, market.tick], endOfRun null, no official
  manifest unless the freeze was due, the identity against its frozen
  entry, the stamp (id, whole sequence, and the phase triple of its own
  phaseOrderVersion read through P15_PHASE_TABLES), and the bounds. The
  law's two "v1" notes now hold in both eras (1359-F6 ruling 5).
- tuning.ts: the v2 values (critic 60, share floor 20, hit line 49, flop
  30), 1353-T section 7.1 with 1353-F6 ruling 1.
- types.ts: campaignLegacy in P15StepRoots, so GameStateV45 carries it.
- save.ts: campaignLegacy in the P15_ROOT_KEYS literal, so the satisfies
  clause holds and every strip, presence check and frozen builder covers
  it; the Legacy last in P15_DOWNGRADE_REFUSALS with "cannot downgrade or
  discard the frozen 2040 Legacy"; the Legacy in P15_SEQUENCED_ROOTS, so
  the one allocator check covers its sequence (1361-F ruling 5); the empty
  root in initialP15Roots (fresh worlds, migration, the historical lift);
  validateCampaignLegacy in validateSaveV45 before the allocator check.
- historical-control.ts: the hash discards only an unfrozen Legacy root.
- worldgen.ts: a comment.

The checks that read other roots (sources, refs), the replay, and the
marker rule's other half arrive with the adapter in (b) and the freeze in
(c). No tick reads the root yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
